        "original_id": "5b119cd5-c02d-5b1f-9725-a0b86e2b03e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Task Force White Eagle, 1st Cavalry Division, United States Army, U.S. military\n- Events: Operation Thayer\n- Places: Binh Dinh\n- Concepts: combined arms division, decorated combat divisions\n\nFacts:\n- During Operation Thayer, the United States 1st Cavalry Division carried out operations primarily against North Vietnamese Army and Viet Cong regiments believed to be in Binh Dinh.\n- The 1st Cavalry Division, also called the \"First Team,\" is a combined arms division.\n- The 1st Cavalry Division is one of the most decorated combat divisions of the United States Army and of the five branches of the U.S. military.\n- Task Force White Eagle is under the command of the U.S. 1st Cavalry Division.",
